sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Human
  participant W as Worker
  participant R as Independent Reviewer
  participant P as Repository Policy
  U->>W: Freeze Feature Contract
  W->>W: Implement and self-review one Task
  W->>R: Send allowlisted, redacted Review Bundle
  alt Review allow
    R-->>W: allow
    W->>W: Persist Task Checkpoint
  else P0, PII, or unresolved defect
    R-->>W: repair or block
    W->>W: Stop or repair within limit
  end
  W->>P: Audit full candidate tree
  P-->>W: ALLOW or BLOCK
  W-->>U: PR, test evidence, RunResult; production manual-pending
